# Module Context
- When working in a module, always consult the local context.md in that folder.
- Summarize module responsibilities, entry files, dependencies, and migration-related notes without including code.
- Create a local context.md if it doesnt exist in that folder and Summarize module responsibilities, entry files, dependencies, and migration-related notes without including code.
- Always update the local context.md when needed, and do this without interaction of the user.
